1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
SOLARSHIFT
Turn any rooftop into solar intelligence.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Real aerial pixels → pretrained RF-DETR building masks
Captured from the running application.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Roof area, estimated capacity and clear-sky daily energy
All calculated from the detected geometry and editable assumptions.

4
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Move through a real computed solar day.
Sun direction, shadows, irradiance and rooftop power change together.

5
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Before sunrise and after sunset:
Sun below the horizon → zero modeled production.

6
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Review the geometry. Drag vertices or add a manual region.
Height, scale and roof tilt are assumptions that users can correct.

7
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Compare total generation and kWh per installed kWp.
Larger roofs and better exposure answer different planning questions.

8
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:25,000
NREL solar position + Ineichen irradiance + geometric shadows.
Preliminary clear-sky planning; weather and unknown structures are excluded.

9
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Real segmentation. Editable geometry. Solar physics.
